  "id": "insecure-attachment",
  "term": "insecure attachment",
  "definition": "Insecure attachment is a clinically relevant psychological feature discussed in major depressive disorder research. In this context, it refers to an attachment-related difficulty linked with greater depression severity, partly through poorer access to emotion regulation strategies and anhedonia.",
